{% set pageTitle = "About — NinerLog" %}
{% set pageDescription = "Built by pilots, for pilots. The story behind the free, open-source pilot logbook." %}
{% set pagePath = "/about" %}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-900 via-navy-800 to-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white text-balance reveal">
      We believe every pilot deserves<br class="hidden sm:block" /> a free, reliable logbook.
    </h1>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     THE STORY
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <article class="prose prose-slate prose-lg dark:prose-invert prose-sky max-w-none reveal">
      <h2>Why we built NinerLog.</h2>
      <p>
        Every pilot knows the frustration: paper logbooks that fade, proprietary apps that lock your data behind subscriptions, and tools that don&rsquo;t understand EASA class ratings or the difference between block time and flight time.
      </p>
      <p>
        NinerLog started as a simple question: <em>Why isn&rsquo;t there a free, open-source pilot logbook that actually works?</em>
      </p>
      <p>
        We&rsquo;re pilots ourselves. We fly GA. We hold EASA and FAA licenses. We know what it&rsquo;s like to juggle PPL and SPL currency, track SEP revalidation windows, and wonder if we need one more landing before taking passengers.
      </p>
      <p>
        So we built the logbook we wanted. And we made it free &mdash; not &ldquo;free trial,&rdquo; not &ldquo;free with ads,&rdquo; not &ldquo;free until we get acquired and shut down.&rdquo; Genuinely, permanently, no-strings-attached free. Open source under the MIT license.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your logbook is a legal record of your entire flying career. It should outlast any company, any subscription, any business model. With NinerLog, it will.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     VALUES
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white reveal">
        What we stand for.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-sky-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Transparency</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Our code, costs, and roadmap are public. No surprises, no hidden agendas.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Community</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Built by pilots, for pilots. From student to ATPL, everyone is welcome.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Data Freedom</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Your data is yours. Export it anytime, in any format. No lock-in, no restrictions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Aviation First</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">We know what pilots need. We fly too. Proper aviation terminology, real regulatory compliance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

